{% comment %}
ZAISEN Trust Page — compact, text-only, multilingual.
Do not imply a large review count or a verified live aggregate Etsy rating.
The five-star statement describes a customer review, not a shop-wide rating.
No legal company name in marketing copy, fake testimonials, badges, image placeholders or unverifiable social links. Show the business mailing address without implying it is a retail showroom.
{% endcomment %}
